<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Zurich Insurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 50 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Zurich Insurance Co.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    625 CHF		   PREMIUM	21.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.13 CHF		  GEARING	9.93 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JUN.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  559 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  UIYY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
